event: content_block_delta
data: {"type": "content_block_delta", "index": 0, "delta": {"type": "text_delta", "text": "四点的城市像是被按下了静音键。路灯还亮着，橘黄色的光洒在空荡的马路上，偶尔有一辆出租车缓缓驶过，"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type": "content_block_delta", "index": 0, "delta": {"type": "text_delta", "text": "车灯划开一道短暂的痕迹。便利店的招牌依旧闪烁，店员靠着柜台打盹，货架上的面包还没来得及摆好。远处"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type": "content_block_delta", "index": 0, "delta": {"type": "text_delta", "text": "传来清洁车的声音，扫过昨夜的喧闹留下的痕迹。几只流浪猫窜过巷口，不怕人，因为这个时间属于它们。高"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type": "content_block_delta", "index": 0, "delta": {"type": "text_delta", "text": "楼的窗户大多暗着，只有零星几户还亮着灯，或许是加班，或许只是失眠。风很轻，带着一点凉意，整座城市"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type": "content_block_delta", "index": 0, "delta": {"type": "text_delta", "text": "像是在喘息，等待天边泛起第一丝灰白，再次醒来。\", \"w03\": \"Recursion is w"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type": "content_block_delta", "index": 0, "delta": {"type": "text_delta", "text": "hen something solves a problem by asking a small"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type": "content_block_delta", "index": 0, "delta": {"type": "text_delta", "text": "er version of itself to help.\\nImagine opening a"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type": "content_block_delta", "index": 0, "delta": {"type": "text_delta", "text": " set of nested boxes: you keep opening smaller b"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type": "content_block_delta", "index": 0, "delta": {"type": "text_delta", "text": "oxes inside until you find one too tiny to open,"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type": "content_block_delta", "index": 0, "delta": {"type": "text_delta", "text": " and that's your stopping point.\\nEach box hands"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type": "content_block_delta", "index": 0, "delta": {"type": "text_delta", "text": " its answer back up to the one that opened it, u"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type": "content_block_delta", "index": 0, "delta": {"type": "text_delta", "text": "ntil the biggest box finally knows the answer to"}}

event: content_block_delta
